# These tests are about raw line terminators (LEX-002): store their bytes exactly, without the repository-wide
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalisation that would turn CR LF into LF.
source_crlf_accepted.egd -text
source_lone_cr_rejected.egd -text

# Binary fixtures (T-0026): invalid UTF-8, NUL, U+FEFF and lone CR must reach the lexer byte for byte. `binary` is
# `-diff -merge -text`: no eol conversion and no text diff, whatever git's content sniffing would decide. The
# leading `# spec:` header block is plain ASCII, so the runner reads it normally.
bytes_*.egd binary
